abstract: >
  EMBER is a research software framework for studying model-based and safety-aware
  reinforcement-learning workflows for internal combustion engine control. The
  repository combines training pipelines, custom RL modules, safety-filter components,
  and digital-twin tooling for transparency and reproducibility in academic research.
